SUMMARY:Free - NAGOYA MARIMBAS Featuring the Kairos Percussion Quartet (Br
 oadview Ave)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you n
 eed to register for your free admission to this concert.**\n\nOn **Tuesday
  September 29th\, attend NAGOYA MARIMBAS featuring the Kairos Percussion Q
 uartet\, the Opening Concert for TD Encounters Soundstream.** Soundstreams
  has unveiled its 2026/27 TD Encounters season\, a free four-concert serie
 s celebrating contemporary music through intimate performances\, world pre
 mieres\, and conversations with leading Canadian and international artists
 . The opening Encounters of the season compliments the first mainstage sho
 w of the season (***[Celebrating Steve Reich at 90!](https://us.list-manag
 e.com/s6sc5nl4Y6k?e=c5e810143c&c2id=7881a45ea32e64e1c7983a9a3d594669&m=FTl
 JnkeIvqp6X6lXhFxc8JZRJMFBJQmkZjPMhkuiuQZNujWdLh4bvwc4llDL)***) by featurin
 g **Reich**’s *Mallet Quartet* (originally co-commissioned by Soundstrea
 ms) and *Nagoya Marimbas*. The program also includes **Ann Southam**’s *
 Glass House #5*\, and *VV* by **Juri Seo**. *Nagoya Marimbas* is a fast-pa
 ced percussion duet frequently paired with contemporary ballet and modern 
 choreography\, and for this Encounters\, renowned choreographer **Heidi St
 rauss** has crafted a world premiere solo dance piece for contemporary dan
 ce artist **Aerin Cho** that echoes the intricate specificity of the piece
 . This immersive Encounters will be performed in the round. **Register for
  your free admission to NAGOYA MARIMBAS Featuring the Kairos Percussion Qu
 artet on Tuesday September 29th at 7:30pm.**\n\n**COST**\nTicket: Free\n\n
 Meetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes**\n* **[Registe
 r](https://soundstreams.ca/events/td-encounters-nagoya-marimbas/?utm_sourc
 e=Soundstreams&utm_campaign=47a81e396f-EMAIL_It%27s+Giving+Tuesday-Decembe
 r+3%2C+2024_COPY_01&utm_medium=email&utm_term=0_b7968c57a0-47a81e396f-1867
 98525)\, post you have registered for free admission**\, and I will move y
 ou to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my cell and re
 minder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior and the
  Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No 
 Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 7:10p
 m inside Hugh's Room at 296 Broadview Ave.**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLengt
 h: 1 - 2 hours\n\nAfter: meet at the same spot to chat about the show\n\nE
 njoy and please post your comments in the Event after.
