SUMMARY:15% off Verdi's Timeless La Traviata Opera (Osgoode Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: offer may be withdrawn at any time.\
 n\nOn **Saturday October 4th\,** **join us for La Traviata at The Canadian
  Opera Company.** Hailed as “the very best that the world of opera can o
 ffer”\, director Arin Arbus’ production has been winning the hearts of
  audiences ever since its original COC appearance. Packed with unforgettab
 le musical moments\, from the ebullient "Libiamo ne' lieti calici" (“Let
 ’s drink from the joyful cups”)\, to the passionate ode to freedom "Se
 mpre libera" (“Forever free”)\, Verdi’s tale of impossible romance c
 aptures the intoxicating joy and heartbreaking sacrifice at the heart of a
  timeless drama. See why *La Traviata* remains one of the composer’s mos
 t celebrated works—and why popular lore has it that\, over the last cent
 ury\, this opera has been performed somewhere in the world every single ni
 ght! My seat is Orchestra Ring\, Row CC\, Seat 135. **Purchase La Traviata
  on Sunday October 4th at 2pm\, and join us for a lovely Dinner for Experi
 ence Toronto's 7th Anniversary after.**\n\n**LANGUAGE**: Sung in Italian w
 ith English and French SURTITLES™\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $35 - $400 + fee
 s\n\nDiscount 15%: Offer excludes Opera Under 30\, Grand Ring\, Ring 5 Mid
 dle\, and $35 tickets\, and is not applicable to previously made purchases
 . Message me for the discount code.\n\nRush: A limited number of low-price
  tickets (limited to two per person) will be available for purchase online
  at noon for matinee performances at coc.ca (please ask for code) or 11am 
 in person at the Four Seasons Centre Box Office at 145 Queen St. W. All ru
 sh ticket sales are final and cannot be refunded\, exchanged or replaced.\
 n\nStanding Room: Approximately 60 are available in-person at 11 a.m. on t
 he day of a performance for just $15! They are located in the back rows of
  Ring 3 (some may be SURTITLES™ obstructed) and Ring 4\, each with a hoo
 k and a leaning rail.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final 
 and non-refundable.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](
 https://my.coc.ca/2519/2528) your ticket and post your seat number and I w
 ill move you to attending.**\n* If you plan to buy RUSH\, please state tha
 t in your RSVP\, so I can include you in the reminder so you have the oppo
 rtunity to meet us.\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior\, and cancellations after w
 ill result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will g
 o out the day before with my cell and details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐
 ‐----‐----‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet m
 e at: 1:45pm** **along the right glass wall\, after scanning your tickets 
 and entering The Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts at 145 Queen 
 St. W.**\n\n**Start time: 2pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours 55 mins (incl. an inter
 mission)\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
