SUMMARY:Anniversary Dinner at new Riley's Toronto Restaurant (St Andrew St
 ation)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Sunday\, October 4th\, join us for Ou
 r 7th Anniversary Dinner at Riley's Toronto.** Originally from Vancouver\,
  where it earned a Michelin recommendation\, [Riley’s Fish & Steak](http
 s://www.toronto.com/things-to-do/food-and-drink/rileys-toronto-job-fair/ar
 ticle_70356d1e-d920-5ce1-a5ef-6da107190973.html) launched in Toronto almos
 t 6 months ago. The seafood and chophouse will bring together “premium C
 anadian ingredients\, cinematic tableside presentations\, and a live music
  program — redefining what a downtown dining destination can be. The ope
 ning marks Glowbal Restaurant Group’s second Toronto restaurant\, follow
 ing Black + Blue.\n\n**COST**\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\
 n\n* RSVP Yes. Everyone goes on the waitlist until they have reserved thei
 r seat\, with an etransfer of $25 (includes $5 meetup fee). Attendees will
  receive back $20 the day after the event.\n* Once you are on the waitlist
 \, I will message you the email address for the etransfer.\n* Once the tra
 nsfer is complete\, I will move you to attending. There are no refunds for
  any reason.\n* A reminder will be sent the night before with my cell and 
 all meetup details. Make sure you set up your communication settings to re
 ceive.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior. Cancellations will result in a No Show
  and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 5:30pm in
 side the front doors of Riley's at 155 Wellington St. W.** Please wait for
  me to arrive\, and do not sit on your own prior\, so we can get the table
  requested.\n\nLength: 2.5 hours\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments in
  the event after.
