SUMMARY:Beethoven's Fifth with World Reknown Pianist Angela Hewitt + Pre-c
 oncert (TSO)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday October 9th\,** **join me to s
 ee** **internationally acclaimed Canadian Pianist and 2026/27 Spotlight Ar
 tist Angela Hewitt perform Beethoven’s Fourth Piano Concerto prior to th
 e Orchestra's Fifth Symphony**. Jörg Widmann’s *Con brio* opens with a 
 witty\, high-spirited homage to Beethoven. Then\, Hewitt brings poetic gra
 ce to Beethoven’s Fourth Piano Concerto\, before the orchestra unleashes
  the composer’s thunderous Fifth Symphony—with the famous first four n
 otes that changed classical music forever. Enhance your concert experience
  by arriving early for exquisite performances by the [TSO Chamber Soloists
 ](https://www.tso.ca/about/orchestra/the-tso-chamber-soloists)\, thoughtfu
 lly curated by Jonathan Crow and included with the price of your ticket. M
 y seat is Orchestra Right C34. **Purchase your own tickets for Beethoven's
  Fifth on Friday October 9th at 7:30pm. I can also extend my subscriber di
 scount to members.**\n\n**PROGRAM**\n**Jörg Widmann**: *Con brio*\n\n**Be
 ethoven**: Piano Concerto No. 4\n**Beethoven**: Symphony No. 5\n\n**COST**
 \nRegular: $70 - 208 includes taxes and fees.\n\nSubscriber additional tic
 kets: $40 - 135 includes taxes and fees.\n\nRush: A limited number of tick
 ets may go on sale at 1pm online\, over the phone\, or in-person at Roy Th
 omson Hall. Limit 2 per person based on availability.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\
 nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-refundable.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP
 **\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](https://my.tso.ca/3966/3992) your t
 icket and post your seat number and I will move you to attending.**\n* If 
 you'd like a discounted ticket\, please message me after you RSVP with you
 r preferred seating location. I will confirm the subscriber discount price
 \, and once you send an etransfer\, your ticket will be purchased and prov
 ided in person at event start time.\n* If you plan to buy RUSH\, please st
 ate that in your RSVP\, so I can include you in the pre-mail and we can me
 et you.\n* RSVPs close 2 days prior\, and cancellations after will result 
 in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will go out the d
 ay before with my cell and details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐---
 -‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for the Pre
 -Concert at: 5:45pm** **at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe St.\, inside the 
 southern-most double set of glass doors\, after scanning your tickets. The
 re are a limited number of seats in the choir loft\, so get there on time 
 to get a seat and sit together.**\n\n**Pre-concert start time: 6:15pm**\n\
 n**Meet me for the Concert at: 7:15pm** **at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe
  St.\, inside the southern-most double set of glass doors\, after scanning
  your tickets.**\n\n**Concert start time: 7:30pm**\n\nEnjoy and please pos
 t your Comments after!
