SUMMARY:Pumpkins After Dark Discounted + Dinner (Milton)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: The 10% off on the site may expire a
 t any time.\n\nOn **Saturday October 10th\,** **join us for Pumpkins After
  Dark in Milton.** Pumpkins After Dark **is Canada's award-winning outdoor
  Halloween event -** a family-friendly walk-through experience featuring m
 ore than 10\,000 hand-carved jack-o'-lanterns lighting up trails every fal
 l. This event is available in Canada\, the United States\, and Ireland. Ea
 ch season\, their team of artists hand-carves thousands of pumpkins\, buil
 ds themed scenes - from dinosaurs and dragons to pop-culture icons - and l
 ights a glowing trail to wander together. No jump scares. Just craft\, won
 der\, and the warm glow of a thousand pumpkins. We will be seeing the **Sh
 ow with the Maze** only. **Purchase your ticket for Pumpkins After Dark Sh
 ow with the Maze on Saturday October 10th at 7:30pm.**\n\n**World Tour**\n
 Travel the world through the eyes of Halloween with displays organized by 
 continent. Pick up a passport and collect a stamp or letter in each contin
 ent to spell a word.\n\n**Brand New Show**\nDiscover dancing leprechauns\,
  a larger-than-life Eiffel Tower\, the Colosseum and Greek mythology\, a m
 oving windmill and Holland flower field\, Mount Scaremore\, and a moving a
 quarium.\n\n**Pumpkinhead Ed Scavenger Hunt**\nPumpkinhead Ed has escaped 
 and is hiding on the grounds. Find Ed\, snap a photo\, and tag @findpumpki
 nheaded for your chance to win a grand prize.\n\n**Interactive Fun**\nExpl
 ore word searches\, puzzles\, pumpkin toss games\, a trick-or-treat area\,
  and stop by the Witches’ Brew to collect your slime bottle courtesy of 
 The Lab.\n\n**Great Photo Opportunities**\nMore photo opportunities this y
 ear—bigger and better. Share your best fall photo and tag #pumpkinsafter
 darkmilton.\n\n**Costumed Actors**\n\n**WEATHER POLICY**:\n\n* This is an 
 outdoor event and will run in the rain. The event may be cancelled in the 
 event of inclement weather\, unforeseen circumstances\, or other condition
 s that may impact safety. Ticket holders will be notified of any changes v
 ia email\, which may occur without prior notice.\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\
 n* Arrange for your own transportation. Feel free to post in the Comments 
 if you want/need to carpool.\n* **Carpool attendees MUST have a picture an
 d arrange a PUBLIC pick-up/ drop off spot for the security of members**. A
 ny risks associated with carpooling are borne by the member\, and Experien
 ce Toronto cannot be held liable under any circumstances.\n\n**COST**\nGen
 eral Admission: Adult with Maze $32.95 + service fee + taxes\n\nDiscounted
 : $29.96 + service fee + taxes\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $10\n\nThere are n
 o refunds.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes** **with your cell and
  email (required for out of town events)**\; **everyone goes on the waitli
 st until they post they have purchased their ticket and have transportatio
 n)**\n* **[Purchase](https://milton.xpresstix.ca/)**[ ](https://www.tcomus
 ic.ca/concert/opera-highlights-all-the-greatest-moments/#season-passes)**y
 our own ticket for** **Pumpkins After Dark by going to the month of Octobe
 r\, selecting Saturday October 10th\, 7:30pm time slot and Adult with Maze
  for $32.95\,** post you have purchased your ticket and have transportatio
 n\, and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day befor
 e with my cell and details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days p
 rior\, hoping there are still tickets\, and the Waitlist will be removed a
 t that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future atte
 ndance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 7:25pm at Country Heritage Park 
 at**\n**8560 Tremaine Rd\, Milton\, ON\, to the right of the entrance Afte
 r scanning your tickets. We will then head in together.**\n\n**Time: 7:30 
 - 10:30pm** (people can leave whenever they wish)\n\n**Dinner: 8:45pm: I h
 ave made reservations for dinner a few mins away.** I hope you will join.\
 n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the Event after.
