DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: Once theatres update their movie lis
 ting\, latest Wednesday that week\, the time and location will be confirme
 d.\n\nOn **Friday October 16th\,** join me to see **Sense and Sensibility\
 ,** an irresistible new take on Jane Austen's iconic book... a charming\, 
 witty\, and deeply relatable story of love and sisterhood starring Daisy E
 dgar-Jones and Esmé Creed-Miles. **My seat is TBC. Purchase your tickets 
 for Sense and Sensibility on Friday October 16th for the Regular Show at t
 ime TBC at Cinema TBC.**\n\n**COST**\nTBC\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* **Simply 
 RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks after**\n* **Purchase your own t
 icket by selecting Get Tickets\, Friday October 16th\, Cinema TBC\, Regula
 r Show at time TBC\, and post your seat number as a Comment**\n* You can a
 lso meet the group at the meetup time with your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs cl
