 itorium TBC\, inside Cinema TBC at address TBC. after scanning your ticket
 **\n\n**Show starts**: time TBC\n\nLength: 2 hours 11 minutes\n\nAfter: me
 et me outside **Auditorium TBC** to head out for dinner and chat about the
